# VTID-03926 — commands run during this change

## Investigation
- Read services/gateway/src/routes/operator.ts lines 1-380 in full: Zod
  validation, threadId/auth-marker handling, task detection, and the
  processWithGemini() call site (confirmed no userRole/systemInstruction
  passed).
- Read services/gateway/src/services/gemini-operator.ts's tool catalog and
  getRouterToolDefinitions()/callerIdentity handling — confirmed a large
  existing dev_* tool catalog (VTID-DEV-ASSIST, VTID-03835/03836/03837) and
  a standing dev_agent_memory recall (VTID-03892) that runs unconditionally
  on every operator turn, all gated behind userRole for the dev_* tools.
- grep confirmed getOperatorRole(req) (reads the client-supplied
  x-operator-role header) is called at lines 648/747 only — never near the
  /chat handler — and req.identity.exafy_admin (JWT-verified) is the value
  already used for VTID-03851's thread-auth marker a few lines above the
  processWithGemini() call.

## Fix
Derived `userRole` from `callerIdentity?.exafy_admin === true` and passed it
into the existing `processWithGemini({ ... userRole })` call in
services/gateway/src/routes/operator.ts.

